# Secrets for the Cloudflare Sandboxes backend. The Deploy to Cloudflare
# button reads this file and prompts for values during setup; for a manual
# deploy, copy to .dev.vars for `wrangler dev` or set them with
# `wrangler secret put <NAME>`. Same rule as the compose stack: only the
# environment key belongs here, never an organization API key.
ANTHROPIC_ENVIRONMENT_KEY=""
ANTHROPIC_ENVIRONMENT_ID=""
